#. module: tier_validation_digest
#: model_terms:digest.tip,tip_description:tier_validation_digest.digest_tip_tier_validation_bulk_approve
msgid ""
"allows bulk approval, you can select several of its reviews in the reviews "
"list and validate them in one go, instead of opening each document."
msgstr ""
"bulkgoedkeuring toestaat, kun je meerdere beoordelingen ervan selecteren in "
"de lijst met beoordelingen en ze in één keer valideren, in plaats van elk "
"document te openen."

#. module: tier_validation_digest
#: model_terms:digest.tip,tip_description:tier_validation_digest.digest_tip_tier_validation_late
