"filter shows the reviews that have been waiting longer than agreed. Start "
"with those: someone is waiting for them to continue their work."
msgstr ""
"toont de beoordelingen die langer wachten dan afgesproken. Begin daarmee: "
"iemand wacht erop om verder te kunnen."

#. module: tier_validation_digest
#: model_terms:digest.tip,tip_description:tier_validation_digest.digest_tip_tier_validation_exceptions
